%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 043bf15b2a6a41c48971e11c678f419c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 472199573504
    m_Localized: "Why'd you skip all the tasty fruit and snacks and eat a KKUL-TTEOK instead?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334352332992512
    m_Localized: "Colored tiles will appear on the floor.\nStand on one for 2 seconds and your score goes up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334425666203648
    m_Localized: "Anyone can step on white or black tiles, but only your own color counts on unique-color tiles.\nDon't block the way \u2014 move fast!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 334428463804416
    m_Localized: ""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708864
    m_Localized: "This game has a Cheer System. \nIf your teammates cheer for you,
      you'll get a buff."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708865
    m_Localized: "There are two ways to cheer: \ntype /cheer Berry in chat, or say
      the Cheer Name with your voice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708866
    m_Localized: "In multiplayer, all teammates (except you) must cheer for you to
      activate the buff. \nIn solo, cheer for yourself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3209884708867
    m_Localized: "Stealth is available. \nPress [Ctrl] to switch between Black and
      White. \nMatch the floor color to avoid detection by enemies and some traps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335177390338048
    m_Localized: "Press <color=#FFD24D><b>Space</b></color> when your color lights up on the floor.\nAnyone can press for white, but never press for black!\nAfter 1 second, it moves to the next turn automatically."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335182629023744
    m_Localized: "Something's moving under our feet..watch out!\nIt's a tongue attack!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335185439207424
    m_Localized: "A tongue will shoot up from the center, blocking your view of the other side and the path.\nEveryone shout the team cheer to bring it back down and repair the broken path."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335887280484352
    m_Localized: "Feels like it's working out!\nIts breathing suddenly got rough.\nHere comes the wind!\nGet on the matching tile and hold your ground!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335890795311104
    m_Localized: "Haah... haah... just a little more and we might actually make it out alive..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335893903290368
    m_Localized: ""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337052009345024
    m_Localized: "This silence... it's gone quiet in here.\nDoes that mean we can finally escape...?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337056501444608
    m_Localized: ".....(CRUNCH!)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337060553142272
    m_Localized: "Oh no, we're being swallowed...!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337068631371776
    m_Localized: ""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337070598500352
    m_Localized: Did we just pass into the esophagus...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337897539088384
    m_Localized: Something feels like it's rolling in from behind...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337902496755712
    m_Localized: Run!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904153505792
    m_Localized: One wrong step and it's instant death. Just memorize the glowing
      tiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337904874926080
    m_Localized: It'll show by color this time. Make sure you match your own color!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337905520848896
    m_Localized: Even if the color's right, black-and-white will kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906154188800
    m_Localized: Each zone has a color in charge. The path only becomes safe once
      that color goes through first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337906812694528
    m_Localized: Catch the fleeing red blood cells!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 337907517337600
    m_Localized: Run from the antibodies and survive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339357207212032
    m_Localized: We've reached the end of the esophagus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339360646541312
    m_Localized: Maybe because it's the last stretch... the pressure feels different.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 339362018078720
    m_Localized: Don't stop, keep moving!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340094578438144
    m_Localized: The squeezing stopped. Phew... we actually made it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340096402960384
    m_Localized: But something's off with the floor...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 340097782886400
    m_Localized: It's starting to collapse!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000001
    m_Localized: "They say you can survive even a tiger's den if you keep your wits about you..!\nFrom now on, just focus on staying alive."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000002
    m_Localized: "Remember where the colored mouths around you are.\nStep on the pad, and that color's mouth will rise up and smash the teeth."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000003
    m_Localized: "Only one color rises at a time.\nStepping on it together won't help."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000004
    m_Localized: "If this place starts to close... everyone shout the team cheer!\nOtherwise you won't be able to see a thing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000005
    m_Localized: "Get into the safe zone shown on screen!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000006
    m_Localized: "Did it eat something spicy before swallowing me..?\nDrool keeps rising up from the floor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000007
    m_Localized: "The floor's covered in slippery drool.\nEveryone shout the team cheer together to clear it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000008
    m_Localized: "Now it's dripping from above too!\nIt must've eaten something spicy, then something sour on top of that.\nIt's definitely trying to neutralize it with a KKUL-TTEOK!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000009
    m_Localized: "Some of the falling drops are targeting me \u2014 press <color=#FFD24D><b>Ctrl</b></color> to match the floor color to your own and break the lock-on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000010
    m_Localized: "From now on, it'll only show you one tile ahead.\nRemember it well!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000011
    m_Localized: "There's something targeting me here too.\nPress <color=#FFD24D><b>Ctrl</b></color> to match the floor color to your own and break the lock-on."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000012
    m_Localized: "This time the tongue will smash the entire left or right floor.\nShout the team cheer to block it \u2014 if you don't, it'll just break."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 350000000000013
    m_Localized: "It only repairs if you shout the team cheer while the warning is up.\nOnce the floor breaks, you'll just have to hold out until the next warning."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
